        "id": 30964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-16T05:45:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We cannot check for exact equality between serialized and original keyrings because the Serialize* methods in the library re-sign identities and signatures leading to the output be different. That\u0027s why we check for the contents of the key rings to make sure contents are as expected. Otherwise modified the test to serialise and deserialise an armored key.",
      "parentUuid": "ea0b0708_8cded6a6",
      "revId": "e07a9149666ad3e69b20849d48f26a67ed8e5928",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": false
